     5303       End.
     5304     End.
     5305   display stream outstream no-error.
     5306   down stream outstream .
     5307   run u-line.
     5308   if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted
     5309         "ИТОГО"                         CHR(9)
     5310         "по объекту"                    CHR(9)  CHR(9)
