     5314         excel-sum (accum total f-sale-sum       )  CHR(9)
     5315         excel-sum (accum total f-sale-other    )   CHR(9)
     5316         excel-sum (accum total f-crsa-sum      )   CHR(9)
     5317         excel-sum (accum total f-qnty-all      )   CHR(9)
