     5320         excel-sum (accum total f-qnty-o        )   CHR(9)
     5321         excel-sum (accum total f-cost-sum-o    )   CHR(9)
     5322         excel-sum (accum total f-crsa-sum-o    )   chr(10) .
     5323   end.
     5324   if n-no > 1 then do:
