     8477           dIsplay stream OutStream with FRAME Zapas no-error .
     8478           DOWN stream OutStream with FRAME Zapas.
     8479         run u-line.
     8480            if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted
     8481            "ИТОГО"                       CHR(9)
     8482            "ПО ВСЕМ ОБЬЕКТАМ"            CHR(9)
     8483            excel-qnty(accum TOTAL f-qnty           )   CHR(9)
     8484            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-cost-sum       )   CHR(9)
     8485            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-sale-sum       )   CHR(9)
     8486            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-sale-other     )   CHR(9)
     8487            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-crsa-sum       )   CHR(9)
     8488            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-qnty-all       )   CHR(9)
     8489            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-cost-sum-all   )   CHR(9)
     8490            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-crsa-sum-all   )   CHR(9)
     8491            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-qnty-o         )   CHR(9)
     8492            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-cost-sum-o     )   CHR(9)
     8493            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-crsa-sum-o     )   chr(10) .
     8494       End.
     8495   END PROCEDURE.
